Package: fastjmespath
Title: Fast 'JMESPath' Queries for R Objects and JSON
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Dyfan", "Jones", , "dyfan.r.jones@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Evaluate 'JMESPath' expressions against R lists, data frames and
    JSON strings. Built on the Rust 'jmespath' crate through 'extendr', with
    compiled expressions that can be reused across queries.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.65.0, xz
URL: https://github.com/DyfanJones/fastjmespath/, https://dyfanjones.r-universe.dev/fastjmespath
BugReports: https://github.com/DyfanJones/fastjmespath/issues
Suggests:
    jsonlite,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.2)
